    "<div>\n        <h3>\n          <span>📚</span> PART C: READING (2.6 pts)\n        </h3>\n        <span>Đọc hiểu</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <!-- Passage 1: Cloze test -->\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            I. Choose the correct word A, B, C or D for each gap to complete the following passage (1.0 pt)\n          </h4>\n          \n          <div>\n            <h5>MY VILLAGE</h5>\n            <p>\n              I live in a village in the north of Viet Nam. Every day, like most of my friends, I walk to school. It is three kilometers <strong>(1) ________</strong>. After class, I often help my mother to collect water from the river and feed the chickens. At the weekend, the villagers often <strong>(2) ________</strong> at the community hall where there is a TV. The adults watch TV, but more often they talk about their farm work and exchange news. The children run around, playing games and shouting <strong>(3) ________</strong>. Laughter is heard everywhere.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              My father sometimes takes me to the market town nearby where he sells our home products like vegetables, fruits, eggs… he then buys me <strong>(4) ________</strong> ice cream and lets me take a ride on the electric train in the town square. I love those trips.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              On starry <strong>(5) ________</strong>, children lie on the grass, looking at the sky and daring each other to find the Milky Way. We dream of faraway places.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Cloze Options 1-5 -->\n          <div>\n            <!-- C1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C5 -->\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Passage 2: Comprehension -->\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            II. Read the following passage and do the tasks below (1.6 pt)\n          </h4>\n\n          <div>\n            <h5>MY VILLAGE</h5>\n            <p>\n              Many people enjoy living in a big city because they think life is more exciting there. However, I come from a small village and in my view, there are lots of benefits. The main reason I prefer village life because <u>it</u>’s very quiet, so I always feel calm when I’m here. Another reason is that the air is so fresh and clean. We have more green spaces and bigger gardens, too. In addition, I think the people here are friendlier. Personally, I’m interested in wildlife photography, so the countryside is perfect for me.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              The only backdraw is transport. I have an early start for a long journey to school in Faro and the school bus is always stopping to pick up more people. Also, it’s boring sometimes, but I enjoy chatting to my friends. Fortunately, I’m learning to ride a moped. On balance, I disagree that city life is better, as I think my village lifestyle is healthier and more relaxing. In spite of that, some of my friends couldn’t cope with life in the country, so it comes down to personal opinion.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- A. Answer questions (1.2pt) -->\n          <div>\n            <h5>A. Answer the questions (1.2 pt)</h5>\n            <div>\n              <!-- Q1 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q2 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q3 -->\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- B. Choose the best answer (0.4pt) -->\n          <div>\n            <h5>B. Choose the best answer (0.4 pt)</h5>\n            <div>\n              <!-- Q4 -->\n              \n\n              <!-- Q5 -->\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
